*.onnx
# ...but the pinned demo checkpoint MUST stay in the build context. The
# Dockerfile does `COPY models ./models`; if these were ever excluded the
# container would boot with no weights and every detection would fail with
# a model-unavailable error. Negations make that intent explicit and immune
# to someone later "tidying" the ignore rules above.
!models/checkpoints/unet_oilspill.pt
!models/manifests/MODEL_VERSION.json
data/ocean_cache/*
data/uploads/*
data/sentinel1/*
*.zip
